Mathematical attribution

The estimate module follows the Perelman finite extinction route and the
Morgan–Tian account with its 2015 correction. The technical report bibliography
and docs/contribution-map.md distinguish mathematical sources, reused Lean
infrastructure, and new formalization and integration. This notice makes no
new-mathematics, priority, or upstream-endorsement claim.
